And so the dogs had to be
constantly like shepherd away

00:08:04.020 --> 00:08:07.320
until the baby was like old
enough to jump the fence back.

00:08:07.320 --> 00:08:09.960
I have a, this is gonna sound
like a bit but it's not,

00:08:09.960 --> 00:08:13.470
I've had like a weird
fantasy about wrestling

00:08:13.470 --> 00:08:15.810
like a bobcat, fighting
a bobcat in the wild.

00:08:15.810 --> 00:08:16.643
You've brought it up a number of times.

00:08:16.643 --> 00:08:18.390
I have. I've brought it up.

00:08:18.390 --> 00:08:19.223
That's weird.

00:08:19.223 --> 00:08:21.330
I mountain bike up in the hills,

00:08:21.330 --> 00:08:22.597
and people have told me,

00:08:22.597 --> 00:08:24.780
"Oh yeah, on this trail
sometimes you run across

00:08:24.780 --> 00:08:26.557
like a mountain lion or
a bobcat" and I'm like

00:08:26.557 --> 00:08:29.130
"Man that's a way to go."

00:08:29.130 --> 00:08:32.850
Like if I jumped off- if I
just jumped off my bike and-

00:08:32.850 --> 00:08:35.010
